OL,3,GNEWSALabour hold council seat after
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour have retained a council seat
OL,7,Fafter a closely watched by-election
OL,8,Fthat was expected to be a tight race
OL,9,Fwith the Green Party.
OL,11,FCarl Austin-Behan was elected for
OL,12,FBurnage in south Manchester with 1,365
OL,13,Fvotes, ahead of Green candidate Daoud
OL,14,FNawaz on 1,037.
OL,16,FThe vote was triggered when former
OL,17,FManchester council leader Bev Craig
OL,18,Fstepped down as a councillor after
OL,19,Fbeing elected Greater Manchester mayor
OL,20,Fin July.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
